;; jinushi 地主 — synthetic seed: world land-ownership records (parcels + owners).
;; R0 seed is :representative SYNTHETIC, never a live registry pull (G5).
;;
;; G1 — a RETURN-to-commons MAP, never a per-person holdings dossier or occupancy
;;   target list: owners are PUBLIC entities or AGGREGATE buckets; natural-person-held
;;   land is folded into a single :aggregate owner with NO person name and NO precise
;;   residential coordinate. Parcel :centroid is coarse (region centroid), never a
;;   dwelling location.
;; Tree-of-Life land doctrine (ADR-2605192100 §1.11 + 2605192245): 地球上の土地は
;;   Tree of Life に帰属。jinushi is the data-ACQUISITION (取得) feeder that surfaces
;;   land 取-concentration routed to commons return; it asserts no transfer/verdict.
{:owners
